  "group": "lifecycle-observability",
  "description": "The lifecycle, docs, observability, defaultSLIs and exposeQoS definitions: the unified lifecycleState vocabulary, each of these objects' closed property sets, their nested enums (onBreach type/severity, alert channel kind, default SLI severity), the isoDuration and availability-percentage grammars, and the 0..1 / 0..100 numeric bounds on SLI thresholds and QoS ratios.",
